ders</label><input id="stepIndex" type="range" min="0" max="62" step="1" name="stepIndex" value="0"/></div><span class="hiddenflex-none text-left font-medium text-slate-800 sm:block">1,000,000<!-- -->+</span></div><p class="text-center text-sm">Up to <span class="font-medium text-slate-800">1,000</span> <!-- -->Monthly<!-- --> Renders</p><p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-800">All prices exclude VAT at the prevailing rate.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1"><span class="text-black">Monthly</span><button class="group not-sr-only relative mx-1 inline-flex h-6 w-10 cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full bg-indigo-500 px-1 transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none data-checked:bg-indigo-500 data-focus:outline-2 data-focus:outline-indigo-500" aria-hidden="true" id="headlessui-switch-_R_2m51tm_" role="switch" type="button" tabindex="0" aria-checked="false" data-headlessui-state=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none inline-block size-4 translate-x-0 rounded-full bg-white shadow-lg ring-0 transition duration-200 ease-in-out group-data-checked:translate-x-4"></span></button><span class="">Annual</span><span>billing</span></div></div><div class="mt-16 lg:flex"><div class="mx-4 rounded-t-2xl border border-b-0 border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 lg:mx-0 lg:my-4 lg:w-1/2 lg:rounded-l-2xl lg:rounded-r-none lg:border-b lg:border-r-0"><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-8"><div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2"><h5 class="inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-slate-400/60 to-slate-500/80 mb-0">Lo-Fi<!-- -->:</h5><p class="text-sm">Screenshot websites you own</p></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-800"><span>$</span><span class="text-5xl font-medium">19</span><span>/month</span></div><p class="text-balance text-sm leading-normal"><span>For up to </span><span class="text-slate-800">2,000<!-- --> renders<!-- --> </span><span><br/>($<!-- -->9.50<!-- --> <!-- -->per 1,000)</span></p></div></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm">Affordable thumbnails &amp; social media image generation. Low quality screenshots of 3rd party websites. Basic support.</p></div><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-2"><a style="pointer-events:auto" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-button font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 text-white ring-4 ring-[rgb(22_88_155/0.06)] hover:from-indigo-600 hover:to-indigo-700 dark:ring-slate-800 h-9 rounded-xl px-4 text-base m-1" data-slot="button" href="/signup?plan=lo-fi-monthly-a">Try for free</a></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-start justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-linear-to-br from-slate-900/80 to-slate-900 p-10 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:w-1/2 lg:px-12 lg:py-16"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2"><h5 class="inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-amber-400/80 to-yellow-600/80 mb-0">Enterprise:</h5><p class="text-sm text-white">Custom screenshot solutions</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white"><span>From</span><span>$</span><span class="text-5xl font-medium">3,000</span><span>/month</span></div><p class="text-balance text-sm leading-normal text-white">Custom capture limits and features.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-white">Dedicated rendering clusters. Use your own infrastructure. Enhanced SLAs. Bespoke contracts &amp; policies.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-2"><a target="_blank" class="mt-8 flex h-8 items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg bg-linear-to-br from-white to-slate-400 px-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 shadow-md transition-all duration-100 hover:-translate-y-px hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-white/10 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500/30 focus:ring-offset-2" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b6c5c3c6c6d9c4c2f6c3c4dad4d9ce98d5d9db89c5c3d4dcd3d5c28be3c4dad4d9ce96f3d8c2d3c4c6c4dfc5d396e6dad7d8">Email us</a><a class="font-semibold text-white" href="/contact">or talk to a human</a></div></div></div><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl mx-auto mt-8 mb-8 text-center">Want free website screenshots?</h2><p class="text-center text-sm text-slate-800">Checkout our free homepage screenshot tool:<!-- --> <a class="font-semibold text-indigo-500" href="https://screenshotof.com">ScreenshotOf.com</a></p></div></section><section id="feature-table" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-24 2xl:px-0"><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Included Features</h2><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base max-w-lg"></p><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full"><thead class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50"><tr><th></th><th class="pb-4 pr-8 pt-4 text-left"><h5 class="mb-2 inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-slate-400/60 to-slate-500/80">Lo-Fi</h5></th><th class="pb-4 pr-8 pt-4 text-left"><h5 class="mb-2 inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-cyan-500 to-sky-600">Hi-Fi</h5></th><th class="pb-4 pr-8 pt-4 text-left"><h5 class="mb-2 inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-blue-700 to-violet-500">Ultra</h5></th><th class="pb-4 pr-8 pt-4 text-left"><h5 class="mb-2 inline