th></svg></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="text-sm"><tr><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top text-slate-800 sm:pr-16">Support</td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Basic</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Standard</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Priority</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Dedicated</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Dedicated</span></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="text-sm"><tr><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top text-slate-800 sm:pr-16">Support Via</td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Email</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Email</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Email/Chat</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Email/Chat</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Email/Chat/Slack</span></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="text-sm"><tr><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top text-slate-800 sm:pr-16">First Response Time</td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Reasonable best effort</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>3 business days</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>2 business days</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>1 business day</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>8 hours</span></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="text-sm"><tr><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top text-slate-800 sm:pr-16">Status Updates</td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Reasonable best effort</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>Reasonable best effort</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>3 business days</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>2 business days</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-8 align-top"><span>1 business day</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base mt-8">* One render will be used for each 30 second period a request takes to render. One render will be used for each 5MB of file size. Certified Archive uses one additional render per year of storage. GPU Acceleration uses twice the renders of non-GPU requests. Each successful captcha solve on Urlbox&#x27;s keys costs 3 renders; solves with your own provider key are free. Requests through a Urlbox managed proxy count at that proxy&#x27;s multiplier, from 2× (geo) to 50× (covert). Advanced features may use additional renders.</p></section><section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 2xl:px-0"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-linear-to-br from-slate-100 to-slate-200"><div class="absolute -inset-y-64 left-0 w-32 rotate-45 bg-white/75 blur-2xl md:left-32" style="border-radius:50% 50%"></div><div class="absolute -bottom-16 -top-64 right-0 w-24 rotate-45 bg-white/75 blur-2xl md:right-32" style="border-radius:50% 50%"></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-start gap-8 px-8 py-8 md:flex-row lg:gap-x-24 lg:py-16"><div class="relative lg:ml-16"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-3xl"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 176 176" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="relative h-24 -rotate-6 md:h-32 lg:h-48"><path d="M14.9839 40.2575C11.6744 50.34 9.99201 60.8853 10 71.4971C10.0021 118.111 41.88 157.242 85.0073 168.349C86.9697 168.854 89.0282 168.854 90.9907 168.349C134.122 157.25 166 118.116 166 71.4999C166 60.6037 164.252 50.0918 161.014 40.2443C159.395 35.3204 154.798 31.9926 149.615 31.9926H148.5C128.249 31.9926 109.877 24.0989 96.2533 11.1915C91.621 6.80261 84.3639 6.8068 79.7367 11.201C65.4041 24.8118 46.3164 32.2769 26.5528 32.0011C21.3061 31.9279 16.6203 35.272 14.9839 40.2575Z" fill="#10B981" fill-opacity="0.1" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M88 19.9026C71.3954 35.671 49.2819 44.3195 26.3854 43.9999C23.4728 52.8731 21.9925 62.1536 22 71.4926C22 112.501 50.0427 146.953 88 156.728C125.957 146.96 154 112.508 154 71.4999C154 61.8933 152.46 52.6459 149.615 43.9926H148.5C125.063 43.9926 103.767 34.8406 88 19.9026Z" fill="#10B981" fill-opacity="0.1"></path><path d="M88 19.9026C71.3954 35.671 49.2819 44.3195 26.3854 43.9999C23.4728 52.8731 21.9925 62.1536 22 71.4926C22 112.501 50.0427 146.953 88 156.728C125.957 146.96 154 112.508 154 71.4999C154 61.8933 152.46 52.6459 149.615 43.9926H148.5C125.063 43.9926 103.767 34.8406 88 19.9026Z" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M88 45C82.1652 45 76.5695 47.3179 72.4437 51.4437C68.3179 55.5695 66 61.1652 66 67V78.0385C62.918 78.2761 60.0088 79.6064 57.8076 81.8076C55.3696 84.2456 54 87.5522 54 91V118C54 121.448 55.3696 124.754 57.8076 127.192C60.2456 129.63 63.5522 131 67 131H109C112.448 131 115.754 129.63 118.192 127.192C120.63 124.754 122 121.448 122 118V91C122 87.5522 120.63 84.2456 118.192 81.8076C115.991 79.6064 113.082 78.2761 110 78.0385V67C110 54.8477 100.152 45 88 45ZM102 67V78H74V67C74 63.287 75.475 59.726 78.1005 57.1005C80.726 54.475 84.287 53 88 53C91.713 53 95.274 54.475 97.8995 57.1005C100.525 59.726 102 63.287 102 67Z" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">The Urlbox $100 10K Guarantee</h2><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">Not happy with your first 10,000 screenshots?</p><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base mb-8 text-slate-800">We&#x27;ll refund up to $100.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-24 2xl:px-0"><div class="mb-16 max-w-3xl"><h5 class="mb-2 inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-cyan-500 to-sky-600">About Urlbox</h5><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">If anything&#x27;s not clear we&#x27;re here to help. Email via<!-- --> <a class="text-primary-400" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d8abada8a8b7aaac98adaab4bab7a0f6bbb7b5"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="41323431312e33350134332d232e396f222e2c">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> <!-- -->or use the<!-- --> <span class="text-primary-400 cursor-pointer">chat widget</span> <!-- -->in the bottom right corner. We&#x27;ll try to get back to you within a few minutes and you&#x27;ll always hear back from us within one working day.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-16 gap-y-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-24"><div class="max-w-lg space-y-8 lg:space-y-16"><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">What counts as a Successful Render?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">Unlike other APIs we don&#x27;t charge for requests that fail for any reason. This happens when a web page is unavailble or the combination of options sent to us is not valid. A Successful Render is one that results in an image being returned to you.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Do you cache screenshots?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">Yes, we cache screenshots for 30 days when generated with Render Links. You can override this setting via the TTL parameter or use the force option to override a previously cached screenshot.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Do requests to cached screenshots count against the monthly quota on the plan?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">No. Only screenshots that are being rendered for the first time or via our REST API count against the quota.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">What happens if I go over my quota?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">No need to worry - we won&#x27;t cut off your service. We&#x27;ll automatically upgrade you to the next tier and you benefit from volume pricing. See the pricing page for more details.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Do you send alerts when I am breaching or close to going over my monthly quota of screenshots?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">We sure do. We will send you an email when you are at 80%, 90%, and 100% usage.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Are my credit card details safe?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">Yes. We never store or transmit your credit card details to our servers. We outsource all of the payment and subscription handling to our payment processor, Stripe.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Do you offer any support?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">Of course! Feel free to try our first-class service out. We generally respond to any queries via email within the same day, and we aim to resolve issues within 3 working days.</p></div></div><div class="max-w-lg space-y-8 lg:space-y-16"><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Do you offer Service Level Agreements / guarantees for uptime and screenshot processing time?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">Yes. Please get in touch to discuss our Business or Enterprise plans</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Why don&#x27;t you offer a free plan?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">We primarily serve revenue generating businesses ranging from single freelancers, bloggers and startups all the way to established businesses and enterprises. These customers depend on us to continue operating sustainably as we have done for over a decade.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">I really want to use you guys, but I just can&#x27;t afford the service right now!</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">We&#x27;ve worked to make our plans as affordable as possible while keeping our business sustainable. The annual Lo-Fi plan works out at just over $4/month. If that doesn&#x27;t work for you, please get in touch to tell us about your project. We&#x27;ll see if we can work something out.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Where do screenshots get stored?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">We use Google Cloud Storage to store screenshot images. If you&#x27;re on the Hi-Fi plan or above, you can choose to save screenshots to your own Amazon S3 bucket. The Ultra plan and above supports any S3-compatible storage provider.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">Your service sucks - I want my money back!</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">We will work with you to ensure our product meets your needs. Please help us make it better by letting us know what we can do to improve. If you&#x27;re still not satisfied after 30 days you can have your money back.</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-slate-800">How do I cancel my subscription?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base undefined">It&#x27;s easy to cancel - just log in to the dashboard to cancel your subscription. Your account will remain active until your renewal date, and after that you will no longer be charged.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="relative h-px w-full shrink-0 bg-linear-to-r from-slate-100 via-slate-300 to-slate-100 dark:from-transparent dark:via-white/15 dark:to-transparent"></div><section class="relative"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 dark:bg-background undefined"><div class="absolute inset-0 transform-gpu blur-3xl will-change-[filter]"><div class="absolute rounded-[50%] left-0 w-1/2 xl:left-16 2xl:left-32 -bottom-1/2 top-32 bg-cyan-500/10"></div><div class="absolute rounded-[50%] right-0 w-1/2 xl:right-16 2xl:right-32 -bottom-1/2 top-32 bg-indigo-500/10"></div><div class="absolute rounded-[50%] left-1/4 right-1/4 -bottom-1/2 top-32 bg-cyan-700/10"></div><div class="absolute rounded-[50%] inset-x-64 h-32 -bottom-16 bg-slate-800/5"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 h-px bottom-0 bg-slate-800 opacity-25 mix-blend-color-burn"></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 pt-16 text-center lg:pb-40 lg:pt-24"><h5 class="mb-2 inline-block bg-linear-to-r bg-clip-text text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-transparent sm:text-sm from-cyan-500 to-sky-600">About Urlbox</h5><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Anything Left Unclear?</h2><p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal text-sm sm:text-base mb-8">We&#x27;re here to help. We&#x27;ll try to get back to you within a few minutes and you&#x27;ll always hear back from us within one working day.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-2"><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9eedebeeeef1eceadeebecf2fcf1e6b0fdf1f3a1edebfcf4fbfdeaa3cbecf2fcf1e6beceecf7fdf7f0f9becfebfbedeaf7f1f0" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-button font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 text-